# The close guard: a dirty document survives the first close request.
open "$DIR/chapter.md"
type "x"
close
expect status "Unsaved changes"
expect dirty yes
expect text "xThe fog came in off the fjord the way it always did in late October: quietly, completely, and without asking. Zoë Ångström stood at the top of the lighthouse stairs with a lantern in one hand and her grandmother’s letter in the other.\n\n“You’re late,” said Dvořák.\n"
# A second close within 5 seconds discards and exits.
close
expect running no
